        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"1d2820da-f39c-4c33-b968-71bf08d04e96\",\"review_text\":\"love this app , all of the music I want is available to download & I'm loving every bit of it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"5621d5cc-4b90-4a14-aa31-982e5dc3b27d\",\"review_text\":\"This was the best app earlier now it is just trash. Will be deleting it and will be now moving to saavn . The update made it just garbage. Spotify who do you think is going to pay you for every other option that was free earlier. Spotify has just become like a money earning platform. How greedy do you have to be. I hope you'd realise your mistake or otherwise you'd become obsolete pretty soon. The update was unnecessary\"},{\"review_id\":\"fab3970e-7538-4e77-b850-fa1b47738df5\",\"review_text\":\"Really good app you can listen to music and turn your divice off and still listen and its free mostly listen to what ever you want and has almost every song i can think of the only bad thing is tje when your playlist finishes it plays random songs also you cant search up piticular book audios\"},{\"review_id\":\"5e664644-c630-4d64-adcf-3937a4f37124\",\"review_text\":\"Osm blosm dosm 🥳🥳🥳🥳🥳🥳\"},{\"review_id\":\"782d23ea-a3a8-4a3e-aa64-532aea362628\",\"review_text\":\"Rabish\"},{\"review_id\":\"238ff342-b1ff-426e-9dd9-c49fc26a69e0\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this application👎🏻\"},{\"review_id\":\"9050fd74-b9c6-47b3-9d5f-8988f9247670\",\"review_text\":\"Always a great experience with this app all around!\"},{\"review_id\":\"e5cabdd4-f8b5-461b-8e99-78ae0de20367\",\"review_text\":\"Love the uninterupted music and the great selection of music.\"},{\"review_id\":\"03952b68-be84-4977-a3db-0377ed32c6c3\",\"review_text\":\"Ilove thes\"},{\"review_id\":\"aaf856bd-6a46-41c7-98fe-0e82b16b468e\",\"review_text\":\"Chart manipulation\"}]}"
